      "purpose": "Start with the usable positive result.",
      "explanation": "For integers E>0 and T>E, sensitivity \u0394>0, \u03b5>0 and 0<\u03b4<1, put a=\u0394/\u221av_FB. The sufficient condition a\u00b2 \u2264 (6E/(3E+2)) \u03b5 gives v_FB < v\u0304_(E,T) \u2264 v_(E,T), with strict full-batch total-variance dominance for every S\u22650. It is a sufficient domain, not a classification outside it or an ordering of every pair of smaller batches. The target bindings cover the transcript conclusions and full-batch reference; the average-only strengthening remains conventional exposition in the supplied assessments.",
