      "targetRevisions": [],
      "purpose": "Keep the experiment and asymptotic scopes visible.",
      "explanation": "The manuscript models independent Poisson sampling of fixed clipped record contributions, homogeneous independent Gaussian noise, and an equal-weight average. Its sparse theorem concerns the complete released transcript. The average-only output has a separate uniform feasibility bound. The manuscript explicitly makes no claim about adaptive optimizer trajectories or training loss, and warns that fixed-rate asymptotics do not automatically cover q=E/T. This scope note is a reader aid attached to the sparse theorem; it does not claim that the formal target encodes these modeling qualifications.",
