      "purpose": "Put the fixed-rate background in its proper place.",
      "explanation": "The appendix gives a general fixed-participation privacy-profile limit and calibrated offset. The exposition compares it with the fixed-rate result cited from R\u00e4is\u00e4, J\u00e4lk\u00f6, and Honkela (2024), while explicitly explaining that fixed q>0 does not specialize to q=E/T without uniformity in q. The source-correspondence assessment describes schedule adapters; this is not an asserted direct identity between differently parameterized statements.",
